>> title: No-Peek Beef Stew
>> source: Allie
>> servings: 4

Combine @beef cubes{1%lb}, @onion{1%cup}(cut), @celery{1%cup}(cut), @carrots{1%cup}(cut), @v8 vegetable juice{1%cup}, and @salt{1%tsp} in a #crock pot{}. 

Set the crock pot to High heat for ~{4%hours}. 

Serve warm over @../accompaniments/Mashed Potatoes{}.